{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent nonauthor merged-SHA review receipt, part 1/6 (24 rows; 142 total). Reviewer session: resume-group03-20261023. Immutable before: b65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd. Reviewed signed candidate: b46efb88356c0d78ee726007b12a62d4feae6ffe. Exact Gerrit 3096 merged SHA: 5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89. All 28 grouped changed path blobs, including generated docs/env-vars.md, are byte-identical candidate→merged. Every selected row has directives, semantic preservation, and bloat removal PASS with a strict word reduction. Complete 142-row TSV SHA-256: 02e042abbe56804e72d174b1f2b63f9a826f37affa92238e25552c9aef9ec1e9.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/__init__.py::D:module@1-17\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/__init__.py:1-17\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/__init__.py:1-4\tGerrit webhook receiver package. The FastAPI app calls rebar's review kernel as a library and posts Gerrit votes. Importing this package does not import FastAPI. Only review_bot.app requires the reviewbot extra.\tPASS\t144\t32\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:module@1-37\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:1-37\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:1-6\tTranslate four-pass code review verdicts into Gerrit decisions. The receiver force-enables dispatch and reviews the cloned tree and diff. Only full-coverage PASS maps to PASS. Findings and coverage gaps remain distinct. A proven reviewed-tree mismatch raises and prevents a vote. The gate owns blocking thresholds and finding-memory by change ID. ``ReceiverConfig.blocking_severities`` has since been removed entirely.\tPASS\t334\t57\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::C:module@76-83\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:76-83\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:44-46\tRetryable interruptions defer without a vote so backfill can retry. Completed indeterminate reviews and findings are not interruptions. Merge coverage gaps keep their immediate fail-closed vote.\tPASS\t99\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:_message_tag@92-95\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:92-95\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:55-56\tReturn the first-line verdict tag, including integrated commit count for a merge change.\tPASS\t39\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:_coverage_gap_reason@103-106\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:103-106\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:64-65\tReturn disabled, LLM outage, or scanner abstain when coverage failed. A scanner finding is a code finding, not a coverage gap.\tPASS\t46\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:_translate_findings@122-134\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:122-134\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:81-82\tMap blocking and advisory findings to receiver records with dimension, detail, location, and any carried-patchset standing marker.\tPASS\t116\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::C:_translate_findings@148-151\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:148-151\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:96-96\tCarry standing only for findings retained from an earlier patchset.\tPASS\t37\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:ReviewedTreeMismatch@221-224\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:221-224\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:166-167\tRaised for a proven mismatch between the reviewed checkout and the revision that would receive the vote.\tPASS\t53\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::C:module@230-232\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:230-232\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:173-174\tCompare only commit names with at least 7 hexadecimal digits. Others are unverifiable, not proven mismatches.\tPASS\t45\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:_resolve_reviewed_head@237-244\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:237-244\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:179-180\tReturn the checked-out HEAD or None without a resolvable git identity. The later tickets fetch changes FETCH_HEAD, not the reviewed tree.\tPASS\t88\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:_assert_reviewed_tree@260-273\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:260-273\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:196-198\tRaise only when comparable checked-out and voted revisions differ. Missing or invalid commit names cannot establish a mismatch, so warn and return. Clone failure is handled upstream.\tPASS\t152\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:code_review_decision@311-324\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:311-324\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:236-241\tReview the cloned diff through the four-pass gate and return decision, message, findings, and coverage_gap. Only full-coverage PASS passes. Other completed verdicts and ordinary failures block, with coverage gaps distinguished from findings. A proven tree mismatch raises before review so the caller casts no vote. change_id keys finding memory across patchsets.\tPASS\t134\t51\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::C:code_review_decision@338-340\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:338-340\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:255-256\tForward a composed runtime into the runner and request. Without one, retain the ambient runner path.\tPASS\t41\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::C:code_review_decision@404-407\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:404-407\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:320-321\tA non-PASS without blocking findings or a detected gap still lacks coverage. Report that gap instead of inventing a code finding.\tPASS\t52\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py::D:append_retries_exhausted_note@412-415\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:412-415\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:326-327\tAppend the exhausted-budget explanation to a coverage-gap message without changing its first-line verdict tag.\tPASS\t48\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:module@1-31\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:1-31\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:1-5\tFastAPI receiver for Gerrit review webhooks. The internal Gerrit route authenticates its origin header and network peer. Public callers use a receiver token. POST /webhook acknowledges quickly, then a worker clones, reviews, and votes. A backfill reconciler also runs. The core rebar package remains importable without FastAPI.\tPASS\t310\t47\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:module@70-77\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:70-77\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:44-47\tPublic webhook and rerun callers prefer X-Rebar-Token because uvicorn logs query strings, not headers. Query tokens are redacted. The deployed Gerrit plugin cannot send this header and uses the internal origin and network checks.\tPASS\t105\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:module@91-112\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:91-112\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:61-64\tA cancelled to_thread coroutine can leave a non-daemon review thread running. Arm a hard-exit grace sized to let bounded store writes release locks before the container deadline. Named offload threads identify this app's work without matching unrelated executor threads.\tPASS\t271\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_install_offload_executor@117-121\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:117-121\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:69-70\tInstall a named default executor so shutdown can identify this app's asyncio.to_thread review work. The loop tears it down on exit.\tPASS\t53\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_running_offload_threads@128-132\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:128-132\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:77-78\tReturn active review-bot offload threads. An empty result needs no hard-exit timer on clean shutdown.\tPASS\t54\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_force_process_exit@141-145\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:141-145\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:87-88\tLog surviving offloads, then exit without joining abandoned review threads. Kept as a seam so tests can observe the action.\tPASS\t61\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_arm_hard_shutdown@158-164\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:158-164\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:101-103\tArm a daemon timer to force process exit after the grace period. Clean exit discards the timer. A stranded offload cannot hold the listener port indefinitely.\tPASS\t89\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:module@171-180\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:171-180\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:110-113\tShare review timeout with backfill and shutdown drain settings with the container budget. Config exposes both without importing FastAPI.\tPASS\t87\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_request_token@199-205\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:199-205\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:132-135\tPrefer X-Rebar-Token over the query parameter so public callers keep secrets out of access logs. The deployed Gerrit webhook plugin cannot send this custom header and uses separate internal origin authentication. Query-token requests remain accepted and redacted in access logs.\tPASS\t68\t40\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792822743280927104,"uuid":"359ba468-ab5e-4335-8ff3-5ead3fed4115"}